 "section_summary": "This section comprises pages 23 through 73 of the Akita Prefecture portion of the Roster of Japanese Educational Institutions, presenting statistical surveys compiled as of April 30 and November 30, 1946. It tabulates data on prefectural special schools (blind and deaf-mute), municipal secondary and elementary schools, and village or town secondary, youth, and elementary institutions across Akita Prefecture. Each entry lists institutional names, locations, founding dates, male and female student enrollment, and full-time and part-time teacher counts.",
